@{
    Layout = "~/Views/Instruction/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}
<div class="instruction-content">
    <ul>
        <li>The commission group A, B, C and D define the commission rates offered to an agent
            on the following bet types: Handicap (HDP), Over/Under (OU), Odd/Even (OE) and some
            minor bet types such as 1st Handicap, 1st Over/Under, 1st Odd/Even, Clean Sheet,
            Double Change, Draw No Bet, Both/One/Neither Team to Score, To Win To Nil, 3-Way
            Handicap, Home No Bet, Away No Bet, Draw/No Draw, FT. 1x2 HDP, and 1st 1x2 HDP.
            Each group has different values for min and max commission.</li>
        <li>HDP, OU, OE (%): the commission rate offered to an agent on the bet types Handicap
            (HDP), Over/Under (OU) and Odd/Even (OE).</li>
        <li>1x2 Comm (%): the commission rate offered to an agent on the bet types 1st 1X2 and
            FT. 1X2.</li>
        <li>Other Comm (%): the commission rate offered to an agent on the other bet types such
            as Correct Score, Total Goal, Mix Parlay, Outright, First Goal/Last Goal, HT/FT,
            Moneyline, 1st Moneyline, System Parlay, and 1st Correct Score.</li>
        <li>[x - y]: input range. If K is the entered amount, then K must be: x <= K <= y.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        <span class="note">Note:</span> only allow two numbers after the decimal point.
        For instance, 1.25 is a valid input, but 1.555 is not.
    </p>
</div>